[{:db/id 17592186175958 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-07220d09-adbb-5d69-80d7-bbbef5274be7" "question-765be8ee-8b33-57cc-babb-5991ad40d4a2" "question-86bc7dc6-b40a-53a5-81fd-6b94c073d41e"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "question-07220d09-adbb-5d69-80d7-bbbef5274be7" :question/id #uuid "07220d09-adbb-5d69-80d7-bbbef5274be7" :question/math-academy-id "q-83949" :question/problem "Compute $\\text{E}[(A+1)(A-3)]$ if $\\text{E}[{A}^{2}]=7$ and $\\text{E}[A]=2.$" :question/worked-solution "Expanding out the square inside the expected value, using the properties of the expected value, and substituting in the given information, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{E}[(A+1)(A-3)] & =\\text{E}[{A}^{2}-2A-3] \\\\  & =\\text{E}[{A}^{2}]+\\text{E}[-2A]+\\text{E}[-3] \\\\  & =\\text{E}[{A}^{2}]-2\\text{E}[A]-3 \\\\  & =7-2(2)-3 \\\\  & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-9eed2828-4a7b-5794-87c9-0670f96099bd"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-9eed2828-4a7b-5794-87c9-0670f96099bd" :answer-field/id #uuid "9eed2828-4a7b-5794-87c9-0670f96099bd" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-6c249428-8d08-51bf-ae81-1bb5765af7ca" :answer-field/choices ["answer-739fc267-7138-5a80-afd7-189d677e4a5d" "answer-0e36a1d7-0791-58f7-8982-868304ac8df5" "answer-6c249428-8d08-51bf-ae81-1bb5765af7ca" "answer-c13fd77c-9ad1-5778-b83e-31cad41c6866" "answer-46a8ef29-eaf0-516d-9633-2006fce4fb52"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-739fc267-7138-5a80-afd7-189d677e4a5d" :answer/id #uuid "739fc267-7138-5a80-afd7-189d677e4a5d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-0e36a1d7-0791-58f7-8982-868304ac8df5" :answer/id #uuid "0e36a1d7-0791-58f7-8982-868304ac8df5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-6c249428-8d08-51bf-ae81-1bb5765af7ca" :answer/id #uuid "6c249428-8d08-51bf-ae81-1bb5765af7ca" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-c13fd77c-9ad1-5778-b83e-31cad41c6866" :answer/id #uuid "c13fd77c-9ad1-5778-b83e-31cad41c6866" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-46a8ef29-eaf0-516d-9633-2006fce4fb52" :answer/id #uuid "46a8ef29-eaf0-516d-9633-2006fce4fb52" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-765be8ee-8b33-57cc-babb-5991ad40d4a2" :question/id #uuid "765be8ee-8b33-57cc-babb-5991ad40d4a2" :question/math-academy-id "q-109311" :question/problem "Compute $\\text{E}[X(5X+2)-3]$ if $\\text{E}[{X}^{2}]=50$ and $\\text{E}[X]=-7.$" :question/worked-solution "Expanding out the product inside the expected value, using the properties of the expected value, and substituting in the given information, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{E}[X(5X+2)-3] & =\\text{E}[5{X}^{2}+2X-3] \\\\  & =5\\text{E}[{X}^{2}]+2\\text{E}[X]+\\text{E}[-3] \\\\  & =5\\text{E}[{X}^{2}]+2\\text{E}[X]-3 \\\\  & =5(50)+2(-7)-3 \\\\  & =233.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-81f9328d-36f0-5c65-8f7c-7e261e12c70a"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-81f9328d-36f0-5c65-8f7c-7e261e12c70a" :answer-field/id #uuid "81f9328d-36f0-5c65-8f7c-7e261e12c70a" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-be60d140-3585-552d-83b8-46780f21eddf" :answer-field/choices ["answer-14f52b46-c4f1-578f-bb31-b313900911f1" "answer-4fcb654d-d8e4-57d2-ab07-b403eb97d3e4" "answer-be60d140-3585-552d-83b8-46780f21eddf" "answer-436176b4-0742-570b-8b2d-7e7ea6f2954d" "answer-8a49c95d-3f9c-54fb-ad81-6165ab7af9af"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-14f52b46-c4f1-578f-bb31-b313900911f1" :answer/id #uuid "14f52b46-c4f1-578f-bb31-b313900911f1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "226" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-4fcb654d-d8e4-57d2-ab07-b403eb97d3e4" :answer/id #uuid "4fcb654d-d8e4-57d2-ab07-b403eb97d3e4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "230" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-be60d140-3585-552d-83b8-46780f21eddf" :answer/id #uuid "be60d140-3585-552d-83b8-46780f21eddf" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "233" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-436176b4-0742-570b-8b2d-7e7ea6f2954d" :answer/id #uuid "436176b4-0742-570b-8b2d-7e7ea6f2954d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "235" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-8a49c95d-3f9c-54fb-ad81-6165ab7af9af" :answer/id #uuid "8a49c95d-3f9c-54fb-ad81-6165ab7af9af" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "238" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-86bc7dc6-b40a-53a5-81fd-6b94c073d41e" :question/id #uuid "86bc7dc6-b40a-53a5-81fd-6b94c073d41e" :question/math-academy-id "q-110008" :question/problem "Compute $\\text{E}[(6Y+4)^{2}]$ if $\\text{E}[{Y}^{2}]=12$ and $\\text{E}[Y]=3.$" :question/worked-solution "Expanding out the square inside the expected value, using the properties of the expected value, and substituting in the given information, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{E}[(6Y+4)^{2}] & =\\text{E}[36{Y}^{2}+48Y+16] \\\\  & =36\\text{E}[{Y}^{2}]+48\\text{E}[Y]+\\text{E}[16] \\\\  & =36\\text{E}[{Y}^{2}]+48\\text{E}[Y]+16 \\\\  & =36(12)+48(3)+16 \\\\  & =592.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-d5a85f0d-532b-5b07-b202-73baf26d36cc"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-d5a85f0d-532b-5b07-b202-73baf26d36cc" :answer-field/id #uuid "d5a85f0d-532b-5b07-b202-73baf26d36cc" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-b3809182-32d0-5d1f-aca6-70df8dd13f1e" :answer-field/choices ["answer-0b84e972-91af-5283-be7d-7b174d7aa34a" "answer-f53461b4-981e-55c3-801a-8234df8336a0" "answer-161b6b27-31a6-5f60-9425-0f9c32ebfa5a" "answer-b3809182-32d0-5d1f-aca6-70df8dd13f1e" "answer-db888a76-ff37-54a2-9ae5-b989f39555be"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-0b84e972-91af-5283-be7d-7b174d7aa34a" :answer/id #uuid "0b84e972-91af-5283-be7d-7b174d7aa34a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "542" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-f53461b4-981e-55c3-801a-8234df8336a0" :answer/id #uuid "f53461b4-981e-55c3-801a-8234df8336a0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "562" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-161b6b27-31a6-5f60-9425-0f9c32ebfa5a" :answer/id #uuid "161b6b27-31a6-5f60-9425-0f9c32ebfa5a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "590" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-b3809182-32d0-5d1f-aca6-70df8dd13f1e" :answer/id #uuid "b3809182-32d0-5d1f-aca6-70df8dd13f1e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "592" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-db888a76-ff37-54a2-9ae5-b989f39555be" :answer/id #uuid "db888a76-ff37-54a2-9ae5-b989f39555be" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "594" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186176042 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-97f24d3e-df80-5494-a01f-c5ae043371c6"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id 17592186176376 :question/problem "A random variable $X$ has the probability distribution given below.\n\n$$\nf(x)=\\{\\begin{aligned}\\frac{3}{10}, & x=0 \\\\ \\frac{1}{2}, & x=1 \\\\ \\frac{1}{5}, & x=2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nCalculate $\\text{E}[{X}^{4}].$" :question/worked-solution "If $X$ is a discrete random variable with probability mass function $f(x)$ and sample space $S,$ the expected value of ${X}^{4}$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\text{E}[{X}^{4}]={\\sum }_{x\\in S}{x}^{4}\\cdot f(x).\n$$\n\nSumming up the products of each squared value of $X$ and its associated probability, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{E}[{X}^{4}] & ={\\sum }_{x\\in S}{x}^{4}\\cdot f(x) \\\\  & ={0}^{4}\\cdot \\frac{3}{10}+{1}^{4}\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}+{2}^{4}\\cdot \\frac{1}{5} \\\\  & =0+\\frac{1}{2}+\\frac{16}{5} \\\\  & =\\frac{37}{10}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id 17592186174514 :answer-field/correct 17592186174515 :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "question-97f24d3e-df80-5494-a01f-c5ae043371c6" :question/id #uuid "97f24d3e-df80-5494-a01f-c5ae043371c6" :question/math-academy-id "q-143794" :question/problem "A random variable $X$ has the probability distribution given below.\n\n| $x$ | $0$ | $1$ | $2$ | $3$ | $4$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $f(x)$ | $0.05$ | $0.4$ | $0.1$ | $0.2$ | $0.25$ |\n\nCalculate $\\text{E}[{X}^{3}].$" :question/worked-solution "If $X$ is a discrete random variable with probability mass function $f(x)$ and sample space $S,$ the expected value of ${X}^{3}$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\text{E}[{X}^{3}]={\\sum }_{x\\in S}{x}^{3}\\cdot f(x).\n$$\n\nSumming up the products of each squared value of $X$ and its associated probability, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{E}[{X}^{3}] & ={\\sum }_{x\\in S}{x}^{3}\\cdot f(x) \\\\  & ={0}^{3}\\cdot 0.05+{1}^{3}\\cdot 0.4+{2}^{3}\\cdot 0.1+{3}^{3}\\cdot 0.2+{4}^{3}\\cdot 0.25 \\\\  & =0\\cdot 0.05+1\\cdot 0.4+8\\cdot 0.1+27\\cdot 0.2+64\\cdot 0.25 \\\\  & =0+0.4+0.8+5.4+16 \\\\  & =22.6.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-802686da-19e2-5e90-856b-10082948e6d4"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-802686da-19e2-5e90-856b-10082948e6d4" :answer-field/id #uuid "802686da-19e2-5e90-856b-10082948e6d4" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-4386d36c-9dbd-5582-8c22-4504cf7121c3" :answer-field/choices ["answer-92d52443-3bd3-516d-bbf6-84b158e700ee" "answer-31869a6a-c7b3-5fd8-aa3e-284f3d59ab95" "answer-